{"id": "ltx23-distilled", "version": 1, "backend": "sdcpp", "mode": "t2v", "title": "LTX-2.3 22B distilled (few steps; not measured yet)",
 "description": "Built for few steps (8, cfg 1). Not yet rendered on this route: treat its speed as unknown until a run is recorded.",
